{"id":"656244","name":"蔬菜玉米粒炒饭","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656244/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冷饭","amount":"200g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"50g"},{"name":"白菜叶","amount":"50g"},{"name":"花菜","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"各种蔬菜切好备用。","img":"images/656244/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋加入碗中和葱，盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/656244/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"油热以后，倒入鸡蛋液翻炒香。","img":"images/656244/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入蔬菜炒散。","img":"images/656244/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入冷饭翻炒。","img":"images/656244/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀加入盐和葱花调味增香。","img":"images/656244/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/656244/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一口饭里有菜有饭有鸡蛋，很香。","img":"images/656244/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}